 {:seon.task/id        :seon.flow.task/stop-transition-faults-are-kept
  :seon.task/problem   "An error thrown in a proc's stop transition is put on the graph's error channel after it has closed, so the fault is dropped. Throwing in a real stop transition must durably record and deliver its fault before resources are released."
